{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1b2amkDtNLrCKMZmLe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't start it now. Park it, and do a cheap version of the receipts work that doesn't touch engineering.**\n\n**Why not**\n- Your strategy is a fixed-date regulatory deadline. Missing it costs you the year's main bet, and customers who can't file on time will churn.\n- The filing feature is 60% done and needs all four engineers until March. That leaves about a month of slack before April. Taking two engineers off for three months would roughly double the time to finish, and it would push the launch past the deadline.\n- The evidence for the scanner is thin. A competitor launched one, and \"receipts\" is a top blog search term. That shows interest in the topic. It doesn't show that your customers would switch, or that the scanner would win new ones.\n- Receipt scanning is a feature, not a moat. Competitors and generic OCR apps already offer it, so you'd be late and at a disadvantage.\n\n**What to do instead**\n1. **Protect the filing work.** Keep all four engineers on it.\n2. **Use marketing for the receipts demand.** Write content that captures the \"receipts\" searches, and add a clear call to action for your filing product.\n3. **Check the demand cheaply.** Count how many lost deals or churned customers mention receipt scanning. Look at what share of blog readers sign up. Ask a handful of customers how they handle receipts today.\n4. **Look at a stopgap that needs little engineering.** Options are a partnership or integration with an existing scanner, or a simple email-in or photo-upload on the existing product.\n5. **Set a date to revisit.** If the evidence is strong, plan the app for April or May, once filing ships.\n\n**What would change my mind**\n- Data showing receipt scanning is causing real churn or blocking sales.\n- Evidence that quarterly filing depends on receipt capture. In that case, scope the smallest version that serves filing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3449,"cache_read_input_tokens":5025,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3449},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d08fbc95-f2cf-4730-b599-d297e5794de9","uuid":"8b421ba2-ea6c-4b79-b13e-aeb3ad28c983","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:14:09.324Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1b2L8mjUpBhzMsC2tx"}
